sequenceDiagram
    %% Three flows: startup load, live edit, background save
    participant U as User
    participant M as Monaco (sync)
    participant S as In-memory store (sync)
    participant F as opfs-fs (async)
    participant O as OPFS (async)

    Note over U,O: 1. Startup — hydrate from disk
    F->>O: await readdir / readFile (whole tree)
    O-->>F: file contents
    F->>S: build Map + create Monaco models
    S->>M: show active file

    Note over U,O: 2. Live editing — all synchronous, no await
    U->>M: type a keystroke
    M->>S: update in-memory content (instant)
    S->>M: re-render (instant)

    Note over U,O: 3. Background save — debounced write-through
    S-->>F: after ~400ms idle: writeFile(path, content)
    F->>O: await createWritable().write()
    O-->>F: done (durable)
